title: panel:toggle
tags: [[GUI command]] [[Panel slots and layout]]
kind: reference
summary: Toggle a layout flag (split / fullscreen)

`split` splits when one slot is visible and unsplits when both are — the everyday layout key; `fullscreen` shows the focused panel alone, the window itself fullscreen, and back (<<key "panel:toggle fullscreen" z>> or Escape). See [[Panel slots and layout]].
